menu "Kernel Frame-Aware Scheduler (KFAS)"

config KFAS
	bool "Kernel Frame-Aware Scheduler (KFAS)"
	depends on UPROBES && CPU_FREQ && UCLAMP_TASK
	default n
	help
	  Built-in kernel-space Frame-Aware Scheduler with dual Surface uprobe
	  telemetry (dequeueBuffer + queueBuffer), devfreq GPU bottleneck
	  separation, multi-cluster FreqQoS closed-loop scaling, and
	  WALT-integrated precision thread placement.

	  Zero overhead when no target game session is attached.

endmenu
